{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>They were the princes of the tribe.</b> For they were taskmasters over them in Egypt and were beaten on their account, as it says ״וַיֻּכּוּ שֹׁטְרֵי בְּנֵי יִשְׂרָאֵל וְגוֹ״ (Exodus 5). (Sifrei)" "<b>They were the ones standing over the counted ones.</b> Who stood with Moses and Aaron when they counted Israel, as it says ״וְאִתְּכֶם יִהְיוּ וְגוֹ״ (Numbers 1)."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:09:46.453217810Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}